{"type":"message","id":"52f64a30","parentId":"01d1933e","timestamp":"2026-02-12T14:57:12.577Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_d8YAVArMvzsmMJ72K3rTFW7e","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"# USER.md - About Your Human\n\n_Learn about the person you're helping. Update this as you go._\n\n- **Name:** Raitis\n- **What to call them:** Raitis\n- **Pronouns:** \n- **Timezone:** Europe/Kiev\n- **Notes:** Preferences include being addressed as Raitis.\n\n## PC Specifications\n- **GPU:** NVIDIA GeForce GTX 980 Ti (6 GB Memory, WDDM Driver Model, Version 560.94)\n- **Processor:** Intel(R) Core(TM) i7-6700K CPU @ 4.00GHz\n- **RAM:** 16 GB, 2133 MHz\n- **Storage (SSD):** Samsung SSD 850 EVO 500GB (~300 GB free)\n- **Storage (HDD):** 1 TB free\n\n## Future Goals\n- **Deployment:** Clone the agent setup to a VPS (currently local-only).\n\n## Context\n\n_(What do they care about? What projects are they working on? What annoys them? What makes them laugh? Build this over time.)_\n\n---\n\nThe more you know, the better you can help. But remember — you're learning about a person, not building a dossier. Respect the difference.\n"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1770908232574}}
